# IT Support Lab — Screenshot Evidence

This folder contains screenshots documenting practical exercises completed in my personal Windows Server home lab.

## 1. Windows Server Environment
Evidence of the Windows Server lab environment running in VirtualBox.

## 2. Active Directory
Screenshots demonstrating user account settings, password reset practice, and Helpdesk group membership.

## 3. DNS and Networking
Evidence of IP configuration, hostname checks, DNS resolution, and network connectivity tests.

## 4. Windows Troubleshooting
An Event Viewer investigation of a Network List Service error (Event ID 7023). This records an issue investigated during the lab; it does not imply the issue was resolved.

## 5. System Diagnostics
Evidence of a selected `dcdiag` diagnostic test that passed.

These screenshots demonstrate learning and practice in a personal lab environment, not production IT administration.Screenshots and evidence from my Windows Server IT support home lab.
